<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND BEAT BRIVE 47-11.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUCKLAND BEAT BRIVE 47-11.</headline>
<dateline>BRIVE, France 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Auckland Blues beat</p>
<p>Brive 47-11 (27-6) in a rugby union friendly on Saturday</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brive - Try: Laurent Travers. Penalties: Sebastien Viars (2)</p>
<p>Auckland - Tries: Brian Lima, Lee Stensness (3), Dylan Mika,</p>
<p>Joeli Vidiri. Conversions: Adrian Cashmore (4). Penalties:</p>
<p>Cashmore (2). Goal: Stensness.</p>
<p>Attendance: 18,000</p>
</text>
